 "text": "Hi, how are things with you? What a great idea. Would you rather do an indoor game day with puzzles, cards, and movie, or an outdoor park day? You can do it cheaply if you shop around and eat before. A small tank and a tank cleaner kit is enough, plus some gloves. Try shrimp crackers or little pringles like things, they' often the same size. And stick to one shrimp a day, they' very strong. Or ask in the school lunchroom, some parents have spare tanks.",
